  "schema:name": "Consent Management and Data Protection Infrastructure",
  "schema:description": "Automated process of capturing, tracking, and honoring a patient's preferences regarding how their Protected Health Information (PHI) and Personally Identifiable Information (PII) is handled.\r\n\r\nExample: Patients are classified in system databases according to their preference on the handling of their information; each classification having a set of business rules encoded to handle data accordingly",
